  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Li Mingji is rushed to hospital with a sudden heart emergency onstage, Bu Xiaogu gives a statement at the police station about fetching his medicine. Listen to the Mandarin lines first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这就是我在化妆间里的全部过程。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只是帮李先生去拿了药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我离开化妆间的时候，他还没有上台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这种病我听说过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那是很严重的心脏病。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是我害他的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我真的不知道他以前怎么吃药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这事真的跟我没有关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "去把李铭基以前演出的事给我查清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "休息一会儿吧，我去医院看看。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这就是我在化妆间里的全部过程。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is everything that happened while I was in the dressing room.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只是帮李先生去拿了药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I only went to fetch medicine for Mr Li.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我离开化妆间的时候，他还没有上台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When I left the dressing room, he had not gone onstage yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这种病我听说过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have heard of this medical condition.'",
      "gap": 0.45
