    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那是很严重的心脏病。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is a very serious heart condition.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是我害他的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I did not harm him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我真的不知道他以前怎么吃药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I truly do not know how he took his medicine before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这事真的跟我没有关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This matter truly has nothing to do with me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "去把李铭基以前演出的事给我查清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go check Li Mingji's past performances thoroughly for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "休息一会儿吧，我去医院看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get a little rest; I am heading to the hospital to check.'",
      "gap": 0.65
